# OpenCode 2.3.0: the mock answers this turn with a bash tool call for curl
# against port 9. The project opencode.json needs the permission rule
# {"bash": "ask"}, or nothing asks; its default lets the command run.
wait-for 60000 Ask anything
wait 2000
text mocktool
wait 300
key enter
wait-for 60000 Permission required
wait 1000
